Open Standard License — STRUMER Reference Implementation

STRUMER — Structural Media Resolution (Video Without Editing)
Shunyaya Structural Media Model

Legal Status

This license is a permissive Open Standard license for the STRUMER reference implementation.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, this license grants rights similar in spirit to permissive open-source licenses, while preserving truthful representation requirements for the STRUMER name and reference implementation.

If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect.

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate a structural media resolution model — not to represent a full media production system, video editing platform, or rendering pipeline.

Behavioral guarantees apply only within the scope of the reference model and its defined structural assumptions.

