Closing Statement

STRUMER explores a simple but fundamental idea:

Video output emerges deterministically from structure.
It does not require editing tools, timelines, or manual workflows as a prerequisite.

Tools may enable media creation.
They do not determine the video.

This reference implementation is released to encourage:

• independent validation
• real-world testing
• safe experimentation

STRUMER is offered as a minimal, verifiable reference implementation of that possibility.

This is STRUMER.
